## Create chat completions

```bash

curl -X POST "{{apiBase}}/fusion/v1/ai/{{aiId}}/chat/completions" \n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \n  -H "Authorization: Bearer {{token}}" \n  -d '{
    "model": "gpt-3.5-turbo",
    "messages": [
      {
        "role": "system",
        "content": "You are a helpful assistant."
      },
      {
        "role": "user",
        "content": "Hello!"
      }
    ]
  }'

```

